{"unit_id":"ldchaowin__dsh-plugin-notify-sound#card-zh","repo":"ldchaowin/dsh-plugin-notify-sound","commit":"d6a267dea612569fd97340e62fb9ff6c7873702b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-notify-sound 是面向 DSH Web 的通知铃声插件：它在浏览器设置中提供完成提醒和注意事件提醒。插件监听会话回合与后台任务状态，按工作区选择完成铃声，并在审批、提问、计划评审、目标受阻或后台任务失败时播放注意音。声音可使用内置合成音、浏览器语音播报或上传的自定义音频；设置面板可调整默认值、工作区覆盖、语音和各类事件声音。适合希望及时留意 DSH 工作完成或需要人工处理事件的 Web 用户。配置保存在浏览器 localStorage，不需要额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:328-419","lib/client.js:630-720"]}
{"unit_id":"ldchaowin__dsh-plugin-notify-sound#card-en","repo":"ldchaowin/dsh-plugin-notify-sound","commit":"d6a267dea612569fd97340e62fb9ff6c7873702b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-notify-sound adds sounds to DSH Web. It alerts when sessions or background jobs finish, and for approvals, questions, plan reviews, blocked goals, or failed jobs. Choose synthesized tones, speech, or uploaded audio; set completion sounds per workspace. Settings stay in localStorage.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:328-419","lib/client.js:630-720"]}
