{"unit_id":"ldchaowin__dsh-plugin-notify-sound#caveat-1","repo":"ldchaowin/dsh-plugin-notify-sound","commit":"d6a267dea612569fd97340e62fb9ff6c7873702b","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-notify-sound 使用前须知：客户端配置保存在当前浏览器的 localStorage 中，上传的音频也以 data URL 配置保存；更换浏览器不会自动共享这些设置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:15-18","lib/client.js:108-130","lib/client.js:474-481"]}
